ldren's play area, and much more.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1187,"cta":{"id":1945,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_e7a88eb997.jpg","hash":"map_e7a88eb997","name":"One Park Square by IMAN Developers Location Map"},"style":null,"title":"Prestigious Living in the Heart of Jumeirah Village Circle","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>One Square Park offers an enviable address at the vibrant hub of Jumeirah Village Circle, one of Dubai's most sought-after residential communities. This strategic location seamlessly combines luxury and connectivity, providing residents with a family-friendly environment surrounded by lush parks, dynamic retail spaces, and contemporary conveniences. JVC's modern infrastructure supports an enriching lifestyle where every necessity is within easy reach.</p><p>Beyond the luxurious community framework, One Square Park places you at the crossroads of Dubai's iconic destinations. With swift access to major thoroughfares, residents are ideally positioned to explore the city’s renowned attractions and entertainment venues. The proximity to top-tier educational institutions and cutting-edge medical facilities underscores the project's commitment to a holistic living experience.</p><p>17 Minutes to Bluewaters Island<br>18 Minutes to Expo City<br>20 Minutes to the Mall of the Emirates<br>20 Minutes to Palm Jumeirah<br>36 Minutes to Palm Jebel Ali<br>30 Minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport</p>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3279,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/10/30/U4K6W0dthrXJXlGzaSK8xiUly69p50MewqLjGlz3.pdf","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/one_park_square_63f0eea29a.pdf","hash"